I'm now implementing the `IntersectionObserver` logic within `Services.tsx`. I'll adapt the existing code to trigger the header's fade-in animation, mirroring the approach used in other sections. I've also identified several issues in `index.html` which include the removal of the importmap due to dependency conflicts. The next task is to verify that these changes function as expected and ensure the component loads with expected animations.


